    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44163" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκᾱμία:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσυχία, ἤτοι εὐφημία</span> (
			Dor.
		), <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			392.5
		</span></i> (i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκᾱλία,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσυχία</span>
			, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκᾱμία</span> (fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κημός</span>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφιμία</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκαλεία, εὐκληρία</span>
			).</div>
